"Swipe even numbers left and odd numbers right." = "偶数向左滑，奇数向右滑。";
"Swipe up from the ball. Direction and length set the throw." = "从球向上滑动，方向和长度决定投篮。";
"Swipe up from the bottle. Land upright after a full flip." = "从瓶子向上滑，翻转一整圈后直立落地。";
"Swipe the paper into the bin. Watch the wind." = "滑动把纸团投进垃圾桶，注意风向。";
"Swipe toward the dartboard. A longer swipe throws farther." = "朝靶盘滑动，滑得越长投得越远。";
"Pull back from the ball and release. Sink it with one shot." = "从球向后拉再松开，一杆入洞。";
"Hold the left or right side to raise that flipper. Keep the ball alive." = "按住左侧或右侧抬起挡板，让球继续留在场内。";
"Drag across the top and release. Aim for the highlighted bin." = "在顶部拖动后松开，瞄准高亮的格子。";
"Swipe to shoot. Bounce off a wall before hitting the target." = "滑动发射，击中目标前必须先反弹到墙壁。";
"Swipe across ropes to cut them. Swing the candy into the goal." = "划过绳子将其割断，把糖果摆入目标。";
"Draw a bridge between the platforms, then tap Roll." = "在平台之间画一座桥，然后点击滚动。";
"Find three differences. Tap them in the lower picture." = "找出三处差异，在下方图片中点击。";
"Find the pictured object among the other objects." = "在其他物品中找出上方展示的物品。";
"Choose the silhouette that matches the colored shape." = "选择与彩色形状匹配的轮廓。";
"Tap each tile to rotate it and restore the picture." = "点击旋转每个图块，还原图片。";
"Tap the right half to mirror the left half." = "点击右半边，画出左半边的镜像。";
"Choose the symbol that continues the pattern." = "选择接下来符合规律的符号。";
"Select a piece, rotate it and drag it into the square silhouette." = "选择图块，旋转后拖入正方形轮廓。";
"Choose a color and paint the grid to match the small picture." = "选择颜色，按照小图给网格上色。";
"The shaded paper is folded and punched. Choose the unfolded hole pattern." = "将阴影区域的纸折叠并打孔，选择展开后的孔洞图案。";
"Move exactly one match: tap a lit segment, then an empty segment. Fix the equation." = "只移动一根火柴：先点亮着的线段，再点空线段，使等式成立。";
"Bounce" = "弹跳球";
"Roll, jump and collect every ring" = "滚动跳跃，收集所有圆环";
"Level %d of %d" = "第%d关，共%d关";
"Jump" = "跳跃";
"Level complete!" = "关卡完成！";
"All rings collected! Reach the green exit." = "已收集所有圆环！前往绿色出口。";
"Hold arrows to roll. Tap Jump to leap. Collect every ring and reach the exit." = "按住箭头滚动，点击跳跃。收集所有圆环并到达出口。";

