"Left flipper" = "左挡板";
"Right flipper" = "右挡板";
"Pull back from the ball and release to throw in the opposite direction." = "从球向后拖动并松手，球会向相反方向飞出。";
"Pull back from the paper and release. Aim opposite your drag; watch the wind." = "从纸团向后拖动再松手，投掷方向与拖动相反，注意风向。";
"Pull back from the dart and release. A longer pull throws farther in the opposite direction." = "从飞镖向后拖动再松手，拖得越远，向相反方向投得越远。";
"Find all differences. Tap them in the lower picture." = "找出所有不同之处，并点击下方图片中的对应位置。";
"Select a piece, rotate it and drag it into the silhouette." = "选择拼块，旋转后拖入轮廓。";
"Select two islands in the same row or column. Repeat to add a second bridge or remove it." = "点击同一行或列的两个岛屿。重复操作可添加第二座桥或移除桥。";
"Select an empty cell, then a number below the board. Use × to clear it. Given numbers cannot be changed." = "先选空格，再选棋盘下方的数字。× 可清除输入，已给出的数字不能修改。";
"Tap between dots to toggle a line. Every used dot must have exactly two lines; separate loops do not count." = "点击两点之间添加或删除线段。每个使用的点必须连接两条线，且只能有一个闭环。";
"Tap a cell to cycle empty → 0 → 1. Avoid triples horizontally and vertically. Given cells stay fixed." = "点击按空白 → 0 → 1 循环切换。横向和纵向都不能连续出现三个相同数字，给定格不可修改。";
"Tap an empty cell to place or remove a tent. Each tree needs its own tent on a side, not diagonally." = "点击空格放置或移除帐篷。每棵树需要独立的帐篷，必须上下左右相邻，不能斜邻。";
"Tap a cell to shade it; tap again to restore it. Connections use sides, not corners." = "点击格子涂黑，再次点击恢复白色。连通只按上下左右计算，不包括对角。";
"Numbers show consecutive filled groups in each row and column, in order. Leave at least one empty cell between groups." = "数字依次表示每行每列连续涂色格的组长。相邻组之间至少留一格空白。";
"Tap to fill or clear a cell. Switch to × to mark cells that should stay empty." = "点击填色或清除格子。切换到 × 模式标记应留空的格子。";
"Drag from a numbered endpoint through neighboring cells to its matching number. Start from an endpoint again to redraw that path." = "从一个数字端点沿相邻格拖到相同数字。再次从数字端点开始可重画路径。";
"Fill 1–9 once in every row, column and 3×3 box." = "每行、每列及每个 3×3 宫中填入 1–9，不能重复。";
"Select a cell, then choose a number. Given numbers cannot be changed." = "选择格子后再选数字。给定数字不可修改。";
"Select an orange match, then tap a faint empty slot. Only one match may move; the equals sign stays fixed." = "先选橙色火柴，再点击暗色空位。只能移动一根火柴，等号不可移动。";

"You can change it later in Settings." = "你可以稍后在设置中更改语言。";
